abstract: >
  FSM-Bench-20 is a reproducible benchmark of 20 natural-language requirement
  specifications for evaluating open-weight LLMs on guarded finite-state machine
  generation under local Ollama inference. GitHub tag v1.1.0 is the public
  replication package for the IST revision: dataset, prompt specification, FSM
  JSON schema, evaluation scripts with conservative guard-aware determinism
  (M0–M3), criterion freeze, unit tests, campaign manifests, aggregate metrics
  summaries, and per-group diagnostics for the 140-run campaign freeze
  (manifest 20260602T195520Z; nested rates G1 98.6%, G2 78.6%, M0 31.4%,
  M1 33.6%). Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20517969 archives GitHub release v1.0.0
  and does not contain the guard-aware revision files. Full per-pair CSV
  records and raw/cleaned model outputs are size-excluded from the public
  archive.
